      "title": "CSA Cyber Trust mark – Advocate tier, Cloud security requirements (Annex B)",
      "last-modified": "2026-11-17T00:00:00+08:00",
      "version": "202504",
      "oscal-version": "1.1.2",
      "remarks": "Includes only Advocate-tier clauses. Derived from Annex B (printed pp. 30–111) of the CSA Cybersecurity Certification: Cyber Trust mark document (v202504), using the \"Cloud security\" column only. Only clauses with a Cloud-specific statement are included; clauses marked \"#\" in that column (meaning the Classical cybersecurity statement also applies) are omitted and are covered by the classical catalogs. Statements reproduce the source wording.",
