                "id": "b.18.8_smt",
                "name": "statement",
                "prose": "The penetration test plan has included the organisation's cloud environment. The organisation has verified that the penetration test plan is in alignment to the CSP’s support policy for penetration testing."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
